.pyright/

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# Environment / secrets
# USGS_API_KEY lives in the shell environment locally and in a GitHub
# Actions secret in CI. It must never be committed — this is a public repo
# and a key in the history stays in forks and caches forever.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# data/raw/            IS committed — a working buffer of fetch artifacts,
#                      pruned to RAW_RETENTION_DAYS by `pixi run prune`.
# data/processed/*.parquet
#                      IS committed — these accumulate across runs and are
#                      the DURABLE RECORD. Because raw gets pruned, ignoring
#                      these would silently destroy history. They were
#                      ignored until 2026-09-18, when the parquet became
#                      accumulating rather than a rebuilt derivative.
#
# Two exceptions below are genuinely derived and cheap to rebuild.

# Rebuilt from observations.parquet on every transform.
data/processed/latest_wide.parquet

# Generated at deploy time by .github/workflows/pages.yml, so local runs
# don't race the cron for the same path.
web/assets/latest.json
web/assets/watersheds.geojson

data/scratch/
data/processed/*.premigration
*.tmp
